1:"""Batched Monte-Carlo tree search: n independent trees advanced in lockstep.
2:
3:Two search policies share one tree structure:
4:
5:* ``puct``   — AlphaZero: PUCT selection, Dirichlet root noise, visit-count
6:               policy target, temperature sampling of the move.
7:* ``gumbel`` — Gumbel AlphaZero (Danihelka et al. 2022) following DeepMind's
8:               mctx: Gumbel-top-k + Sequential Halving at the root, deterministic
9:               interior selection, "completed Q" improved-policy target. Works
10:               with very few simulations (16–64) and needs no noise/temperature.
11:
12:Simulation i (1..n_sims) creates at most one node per tree, stored in slot i,
13:so all tree arrays are fixed-size (n, n_sims + 1, ...). Each simulation costs
14:one batched network call over the n leaves.
15:
16:Value convention: value_sum[node] accumulates values from the perspective of
17:the player to move AT that node (same convention as the network). Selection at
18:a parent therefore uses Q(child) = -value_sum[child] / visit[child].
19:"""
20:from __future__ import annotations
21:
22:import math
23:from dataclasses import dataclass
24:
25:import torch
26:
27:from .batch import legal_mask, step_state, terminal_value
28:
29:
30:@dataclass
31:class MCTSConfig:
32:    n_sims: int = 32
33:    mode: str = "gumbel"  # "gumbel" | "puct"
34:    max_depth: int = 82
35:    # gumbel
36:    m_considered: int = 16
37:    gumbel_scale: float = 1.0  # 0 => deterministic (evaluation)
38:    c_visit: float = 50.0
39:    c_scale: float = 0.1  # mctx value_scale (q rescaled to [0,1])
40:    # puct
41:    c_puct: float = 1.25
42:    fpu: float = 0.0
43:    dirichlet_alpha: float = 1.0
44:    noise_frac: float = 0.25
45:    temperature: float = 1.0
46:    temp_moves: int = 10  # plies sampled ∝ visits^(1/T) before switching to argmax
47:
48:
49:@dataclass
50:class SearchResult:
51:    policy: torch.Tensor  # (n, 81) training target
52:    action: torch.Tensor  # (n,) chosen move
53:    visits: torch.Tensor  # (n, 81) root child visit counts
54:    root_value: torch.Tensor  # (n,) search value estimate, side-to-move perspective
55:    raw_value: torch.Tensor  # (n,) network value at root
