4:  side-to-move perspective) instead of gathered through child nodes;
5:* no boolean-mask indexing and no per-level host syncs — at most one sync per
6:  simulation (to bound the descent loop), or none with sync_per_sim=False;
7:* a fully vectorised backup (one index_add_ per statistic);
8:* optional CUDA-graph replay of the whole simulation (cuda_graph=True): one graph
9:  per descent length, captured on first use; the simulation index, the Gumbel
10:  schedule column, the Gumbel noise and the root logits are static tensors;
11:* two self-play changes motivated by run dev1 (RESULTS-dev1.md): an optional
12:  uniform floor mixed into the root prior, and sampling the self-play move from
13:  the improved policy for the first `sample_moves` plies.
